    <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#10;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\n' Shared academic presentation; identities and authority belong in comments/index.\nskinparam monochrome true\nskinparam backgroundColor white\nskinparam shadowing false\nskinparam defaultFontName Arial\nskinparam defaultFontSize 14\nskinparam defaultFontColor black\nskinparam titleFontSize 18\nskinparam titleFontColor black\nskinparam ArrowColor black\nskinparam ArrowThickness 1\nskinparam roundCorner 0\nskinparam nodesep 35\nskinparam ranksep 45\nskinparam ActorBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ActorBorderColor black\nskinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ParticipantBorderColor black\nskinparam ControlBackgroundColor white\nskinparam BoundaryBackgroundColor white\nskinparam DatabaseBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ClassBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ClassBorderColor black\nskinparam ClassHeaderBackgroundColor white\nskinparam EntityBackgroundColor white\nskinparam EntityBorderColor black\nskinparam ActivityBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ActivityBorderColor black\nskinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ActivityDiamondBorderColor black\nskinparam StateBackgroundColor white\nskinparam StateBorderColor black\nskinparam PackageBackgroundColor white\nskinparam PackageBorderColor #555555\nskinparam RectangleBackgroundColor white\nskinparam RectangleBorderColor black\nskinparam NoteBackgroundColor white\nskinparam NoteBorderColor black\nskinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #555555\nskinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor white\nskinparam sequenceGroupBodyBackgroundColor white\n' diagram-id: STA-03\n' classification: TARGET\n' authority: ADR-034/035/036/043; UC-10/11/12\n' Two lifecycles on one page; immutable assessment composition has no Teacher draft/edit path.\n' Logical source retention does not choose physical Lesson source-freeze fields.\ntitle Sơ đồ trạng thái – Lesson và version đánh giá\nleft to right direction\nstate \&quot;Lesson revision / package\&quot; as LessonFlow {\n  state \&quot;Nháp / correction được phép\&quot; as L_DRAFT\n  state \&quot;Lesson chờ duyệt\&quot; as L_REVIEW\n  state \&quot;Lesson cần sửa\&quot; as L_CHANGES\n  state \&quot;Lesson đã duyệt\&quot; as L_APPROVED\n  state \&quot;Lesson đã xuất bản\&quot; as L_PUBLISHED\n  state \&quot;Lesson đã lưu trữ\&quot; as L_ARCHIVED\n  state \&quot;Lesson đã thu hồi\&quot; as L_WITHDRAWN\n  [*] --&gt; L_DRAFT : Teacher hiện được giao tạo/correction\n  L_DRAFT --&gt; L_REVIEW : Teacher submit Lesson; giữ nguồn và episode\n  L_REVIEW --&gt; L_CHANGES : Admin feedback\n  L_CHANGES --&gt; L_REVIEW : Teacher hiện phụ trách sửa/nộp nguồn; giữ history\n  L_REVIEW --&gt; L_APPROVED : Admin approve\n  L_APPROVED --&gt; L_PUBLISHED : Admin publish thành công\n  L_PUBLISHED --&gt; L_PUBLISHED : Bản sửa là revision mới; bản này giữ nguyên\n  L_PUBLISHED --&gt; L_ARCHIVED : Replacement publish thành công\n  L_PUBLISHED --&gt; L_WITHDRAWN : Admin withdraw\n}\nstate \&quot;Assessment version do hệ thống ghép\&quot; as AssessmentFlow {\n  state \&quot;Version hoàn chỉnh chờ duyệt\&quot; as A_REVIEW\n  state \&quot;Version nhận feedback; composition giữ nguyên\&quot; as A_CHANGES\n  state \&quot;Version đã duyệt\&quot; as A_APPROVED\n  state \&quot;Version đã xuất bản\&quot; as A_PUBLISHED\n  state \&quot;Version đã lưu trữ\&quot; as A_ARCHIVED\n  state \&quot;Version đã thu hồi\&quot; as A_WITHDRAWN\n  [*] --&gt; A_REVIEW : System assembly đủ submitted sources theo blueprint\n  A_REVIEW --&gt; A_CHANGES : Admin feedback item/toàn version → source Lessons\n  A_CHANGES --&gt; [*] : Giữ version; nguồn sửa/nộp lại tạo successor A_REVIEW mới\n  A_REVIEW --&gt; A_APPROVED : Admin approve đúng version/readiness\n  A_APPROVED --&gt; A_PUBLISHED : Admin publish thành công\n  A_PUBLISHED --&gt; A_PUBLISHED : Nguồn sửa → version mới; attempt vẫn pin version này\n  A_PUBLISHED --&gt; A_ARCHIVED : Successor publish thành công\n  A_PUBLISHED --&gt; A_WITHDRAWN : Admin withdraw\n}\n' Assembly with insufficient/invalid inputs creates no partial version/state instance.\n' Creator/creation episode, source submission/submitter and current Teacher are distinct.\n' Completed evidence/history survives replacement/withdrawal; no hard delete or forced repeat.\n@enduml\n&quot;,&#10;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#10;}" id="plantuml-5"><mxCell style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="0" height="0" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>

